     So I[0m[2m'll go with the[0m[2m reorder[0m[2m approach without a lock[0m[2m. Let[0m[2m me also add a[0m[2m lock to `Inventory[0m[2m` to make `[0m[2mdecrement` truly[0m[2m atomic ([0m[2meven[0m[2m though it already is[0m[2m within a single event[0m[2m loop, since[0m[2m the check[0m[2m-and-decrement has[0m[2m no await between them[0m[2m). Actually, it[0m[2m's already atomic in[0m[2m the asyncio[0m[2m sense. I[0m[2m don[0m[2m't need to[0m[2m add a lock.[0m[2m
     
